      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Chinook hosts Fort Columbia Historic State Park, the most intact coastal defense unit in the U.S., where visitors can explore restored barracks and gun emplacements.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        28,
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
